{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33334","headline":"登越王楼即事 · 牛徵","name":"登越王楼即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危楼送远目，信美奈乡情。\n转岸孤舟疾，衔山落照明。\n萧条看草色，惆怅认江声。\n谁会登临恨，从军白发生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}